{
  "> 20 <": {
    "translation": "> 20 <",
    "countdown": 20
  },
  "> Go back to the van. <": {
    "translation": "> 回到车上去 <"
  },
  ">Goliath: I must not be defeated...in a place like this..": {
    "translation": ">Goliath: 我绝不能在这样的地方被击败..."
  },
  ">Goliath: Insolent human!You're the one who's going to die!": {
    "translation": ">Goliath: 无礼的人类!你才是那个会死的人!"
  },
  ">Goliath: You'll be sorry for this!": {
    "translation": ">Goliath: 你会为此后悔的!"
  },
  ">Nero: Yeah,Maybe i will.Sorry I'm about to kill ya!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 是啊,也许我会的.抱歉,我马上就要杀了你!"
  },
  ">Goliath: Stop buzzing around!": {
    "translation": ">Goliath: 别再到处嗡嗡叫了!"
  },
  ">Goliath: Human..I wasn't expecting any survivors!": {
    "translation": ">Goliath: 人类...我没想到会有幸存者!"
  },
  "< Map by @Seth (英俊) >": {
    "translation": "< 地图由@Seth(英俊)制作,翻译:初心心 >"
  },
  "< Map require keep cs2f_use_old_push enable! >": {
    "translation": "< 地图需要保持cs2f_use_old_push启用! >"
  },
  "> 15 <": {
    "translation": "> 15 <",
    "countdown": 15
  },
  "MAP NOW WIP,THIS VERSION ONLY FOR TRY OUT": {
    "translation": "地图目前未完成,该版本仅供预览游玩"
  },
  "> Zombie Item's ability unlock in 20 sec. <": {
    "translation": "> 僵尸能力将在20秒后解锁 <"
  },
  ">Dante: Round two!": {
    "translation": ">Dante: 第二轮!"
  },
  ">Dante: V,Get Nero out of here!This was a bad move!": {
    "translation": ">Dante: V,把Nero赶出去真是个糟糕的选择! "
  },
  ">Nero: I can still fight!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 我还能战斗!"
  },
  ">Dante: Nero,go!You're just dead weight.": {
    "translation": ">Dante: Nero,走!你只是个累赘."
  },
  ">Nero: Back off!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 退后!"
  },
  ">Nero: That bastard called me dead weight!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 那个混蛋说我是累赘!"
  },
  ">Nero: I didn't come all this way for nothing!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 我可没白跑这么远!"
  },
  ">V: Stop hitting yourself.": {
    "translation": ">V: 别再打自己了."
  },
  ">V: And think of ways to get stronger and actually help.": {
    "translation": ">V: 想办法让自己变得更强大,真正提供帮助"
  },
  ">V: If dante loses...you are all that can defeat Urizen.": {
    "translation": ">V: 如果dante输了...你是唯一能打败Urizen的人."
  },
  ">Nero: Is that what you called him?": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 你是这么叫他的吗?"
  },
  ">V: Yes,Urizen,The demon king...": {
    "translation": ">V: 是的,Urizen,恶魔之王..."
  },
  ">V: That's the name of the demon that took your arm.": {
    "translation": ">V: 那是夺去你手臂的恶魔的名字."
  },
  ">Nero: What am i doin',wasting my time here?He's got this.": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 我在做什么,在这里浪费时间?他有这个."
  },
  ">V: You should not underestimate this demon.": {
    "translation": ">V: 你不应该低估这个恶魔."
  },
  ">V: After all,It was he who took your right arm...": {
    "translation": ">V: 毕竟,是他夺走了你的右臂..."
  },
  "V: ...and gained a great deal of power from it.": {
    "translation": ">V: ...并因此获得了抛瓦."
  },
  ">V: I'm leaving.": {
    "translation": ">V: 我要走了."
  },
  ">V: I'm suggest you do not fall behind.": {
    "translation": ">V: 我建议你不要落后."
  },
  ">Nero: Yeah...": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 是啊..."
  },
  ">Nero: Ok V...You're an interesting guy,But you're right.": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 好的V...你是个有趣的人,但你说得对."
  },
  ">Nero: I've got a score to settle with that son of a bitch.": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 我得去解决那个混蛋."
  },
  ">Nero: Hey,jackass!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 嘿,混蛋!"
  },
  ">Nero: Didn't your mother ever teach you it's not nice to steal?": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 你妈妈没教过你偷东西是不好的吗?"
  },
  ">Nero: Sorry,Dante...": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 抱歉,Dante..."
  },
  ">Nero: I'm baggin' this bitch!": {
    "translation": ">Nero: 我要干掉这个混蛋!"
  },
  ">???: ...": {
    "translation": ">???: ..."
  },
