  "> 5 <": {
    "translation": "> 5 <",
    "countdown": 5
  },
  "< Beware,Middle area are no longer sealed. >": {
    "translation": "< 注意,中间区域不再封闭. >"
  },
  ">Dante: This portal will bring us to Urizen.": {
    "translation": ">Dante: 这个传送门将带我们前往Urizen的位置."
  },
  ">Dante: Let's finish this,Once for all.": {
    "translation": ">Dante: 让我们彻底结束这一切吧."
  },
  ">Dante: Those Qliphoth trees are getting out of control.": {
    "translation": ">Dante: 那些邪恶之树已经失控了."
  },
  ">Urizen: Dante...You dare approach me in that form?": {
    "translation": ">Urizen: Dante...你竟敢以那种形式接近我?"
  },
  "< Defend zombies and defeat Urizen. >": {
    "translation": "< 防御僵尸并击败Urizen. >"
  },
  "< Human character can deal damage to Urizen with any attacks now. >": {
    "translation": "< 人类角色现在可以使用任何攻击对Urizen造成伤害. >"
  },
  ">Urizen: Very well,I shall show you...": {
    "translation": ">Urizen: 很好,我将向你展示..."
  },
  ">Urizen: My true POWER!": {
    "translation": ">Urizen: 我真正的抛瓦!"
  },
  ">Urizen: How..how are you so powerful!?": {
    "translation": ">Urizen: 你..你怎么那么强大!?"
  },
  ">Urizen: You never lost anything!": {
    "translation": ">Urizen: 你从未失去过任何东西!"
  },
  ">Dante: You threw away everything you ever had..": {
    "translation": ">Dante: 你抛弃了你曾经拥有的一切.."
  },
  ">Dante: No wonder you have no true power!": {
    "translation": ">Dante: 难怪你没有真正的抛瓦!"
  },
  ">Urizen: DANTEEEE!": {
    "translation": ">Urizen: DANTEEEE!"
  },
  ">V: While thy branches mix with mine,and our roots together join.": {
    "translation": ">V: 当你的枝与我的枝交合,我们的根连在一起."
  },
  ">Dante: ..Vergil!": {
    "translation": ">Dante: ..Vergil!"
  },
  "< Human character can't damage Vergil. >": {
